<title>UK: Stagecoach to steam ahead on strong figures.</title>
<headline>Stagecoach to steam ahead on strong figures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK transport business Stagecoach Holdings Plc were set to open higher on Tuesday after the company's results beat forecasts.</p>
<p>&quot;These are quality results from an increasingly quality company,&quot; said analyst Nigel Hawkins of Yamaichi.</p>
<p>Acquisitions helped Stagecoach to increase profits almost threefold to 120.5 million stg. Total dividend rose to 9.0p from 6.7p.  </p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
